    "solution": "$(f\\circ g)(x)=f\\big(g(x)\\big)$. \\\\\na) $f(g(x))=5(x-4)+3=5x-17$. \\\\\nb) $f(g(x))=(2x+1)^2-1=4x^2+4x$. \\\\\nc) $f(g(x))=\\sqrt{x^2+2}$. \\\\\nd) $f(g(x))=\\dfrac{1}{(x+5)-3}=\\dfrac{1}{x+2}$.",
